      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><span class=\"ds-row-main\"><span class=\"ds-row-name\">연돈</span><span class=\"ds-row-meta\">120m · 도보 2분</span></span><button class=\"ds-row-action\">여기로 정했어요</button></div>",
